# Smoke: two players and a staff member on the minimal world.
# Boots the real server, creates characters, plays a little, saves, restarts,
# and checks that an item survives the restart. Any crash or sanitizer report
# in the logs fails the run.
staff  Smokestaff
actor  Smokewarrior class=WARRIOR level=20
actor  Smokecleric  class=CLERIC  level=20

Smokewarrior> look
Smokewarrior> score
Smokewarrior? ^\s*Score information for Smokewarrior\b
Smokewarrior> who
Smokewarrior? Smokecleric

Smokecleric> say hello there
Smokewarrior? hello there

until Smokestaff /created/ max 3 load obj 18
Smokestaff> give longsword Smokewarrior
Smokewarrior? silverish longsword
Smokewarrior> wield longsword
Smokewarrior? You wield

restart

Smokewarrior> equipment
Smokewarrior? silverish longsword
Smokewarrior! Smokecleric says
